OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds protest plan for
OL,4,Ayear-round dog beach ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a consultation document, Conwy
OL,7,Fcouncil said dog-related issues were a
OL,8,F"key concern" for communities.
